# E019 · When Restrictions Sustain Their Own Reasons

[Essay catalogue](../README.md) · [Original manuscript](original.md)

## How this essay was made

One of the first ten essays. A fresh author chose the philosophical direction, worked from primary sources, received criticism from a separate context, and revised. Other essays and the coordinator’s wider archive were excluded from the research context.

Campaign: `pilot10-20260908` · Lineage: `essay-09`. The midterm ID is a blinded corpus label, not a rank.

Recorded model observations: `gpt-6-astra`, `gpt-6-astra / ultra`. These identify recorded configurations, not independent backend attestation.

